OL,3,GNEWSAGenetically testing every cow in
OL,4,ANI could help keep price in the shops
OL,5,Adown
OL,6,
OL,7,FJohn Edgar has spent his life breeding
OL,8,Fcows, but genetic testing is showing
OL,9,Fhim there is more to his herd than
OL,10,Fmeets the eye.
OL,12,FThe farmer has discovered that some of
OL,13,Fhis animals, which might previously
OL,14,Fhave been overlooked when choosing
OL,15,Fwhich cows to breed from, have valuable
OL,16,Ftraits that could help improve his
OL,17,Fherd.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
