OL,3,GNEWSAGenetically testing every cow in
OL,4,ANI could help keep price in the shops
OL,5,Adown
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe is among the farmers taking part in
OL,8,Fa #16.6m scheme to genetically test
OL,9,Fevery cow in Northern Ireland, with the
OL,10,Faim of breeding healthier, more
OL,11,Fproductive animals while reducing
OL,12,Femissions.
OL,14,FDale Farm CEO Nick Whelan says
OL,15,Fimproving the suply chain can help keep
OL,16,Fcosts low for consumers.
